    "body": "> As far as I know redirect responses are cacheable. I'm also not sure why that would result in the redirect not getting followed.\r\n\r\nOK, I guess I see now what you’re saying: The UA is intentionally supposed to cache each 30x response, and then re-follow that redirect every time it re-loads that 30x response from its cache?",
